%% Diagram source: docs/diagram/completion-v3-sequence.mmd
sequenceDiagram
  participant P as parent monitor
  participant C as child bridge / Pi
  participant J as session JSONL
  participant F as completion-fence.json
  participant A as fence ACK
  participant D as complete.json V3
  participant S as exact surface or pane
  participant L as process-local scheduler
  participant Q as durable tree permit
  participant R as startup reaper
  participant V as bounded V3 verifier

  alt child terminal completion
    Note over P,C: At launch, a new parent strips inherited values and issues only negotiated exact v1 capabilities
    C->>F: immutable fence (runId, nonce)
    P->>P: run result FIFO, stop scheduling and drain parent lease writer (bounded)
    alt lease drain and exact ACK succeed
      P->>A: durable ACK bound to exact runId + nonce
      alt success completion
        alt parent issued metadata-tail success capability = v1
          C->>J: capture final assistant plus linked metadata-tail boundary
        else rolling old parent, capability absent
          C->>J: capture legacy assistant-only success boundary
        end
      else generic failure / abort / orphan
        alt parent issued failure-boundary capability = v1
          C->>J: capture generic failure boundary
        else rolling old parent, capability absent
          Note over C,D: Publish strict legacy boundary-less failure, no exact final replay
        end
      end
      C->>D: create-if-absent child V3 completion
      C-->>P: completion-ready hint only
    else ACK deadline and no exact-dead-parent proof
      C->>D: create-if-absent boundary-less bridge-error V3
      C-->>P: recovery hint only
      Note over C,Q: No successful boundary, final drain, target close, or permit settlement
    else exact parent death proved
      C->>J: capture terminal boundary without ACK
      C->>D: create-if-absent child V3 completion
    end
  else parent terminal failure / abort
    P->>P: run FIFO, stop scheduling and drain lease writer (bounded)
    alt terminal preparation is ready
      P->>F: publish or verify immutable fence
      P->>A: durable ACK bound to exact runId + nonce
      P->>J: capture provable generic failure boundary
      P->>D: create-if-absent parent V3 (incl. parent-aborted)
    else drain, fence, ACK, or boundary wait times out/fails
      P->>P: fail closed, retain exact target and recovery metadata
    end
  else stale startup recovery
    R->>R: prove claim plus owner quiescence or exact death
    R->>S: bounded exact inspect / cleanup only
    R->>J: then capture provable generic failure boundary
    R->>D: create-if-absent reaper observer failure
    Note over R,D: Separate no-fence/no-ACK/no-parent-FIFO path
  end

  P->>D: read immutable winner
  alt valid V3 with a session boundary
    P->>V: reserve prefix and verify identity, offset, entry ID, digest (bounded)
    alt verifier accepts before deadline
      V->>J: descriptor-bound verified prefix
      P->>J: replay exactly to boundary
      P->>S: bounded exact interrupt / close / absence check
      alt target absent
        Note over S,Q: Target absence proves only target cleanup, never permit authority
      else target unresolved or wait fails
        P->>P: fail closed, retain target registry and recovery metadata
      end
    else verifier wait fails or times out
      P->>P: fail closed, retain exact target and recovery metadata
    end
  else current boundary-less or invalid V3
    P->>P: retain status, diagnostics, transcript, and exact target
    Note over P,Q: No final replay, completion-authorized close, or immediate tree-permit settlement
  end

  P->>L: return from monitor, release process-local scheduler slot
  Note over L,Q: This local release is independent of durable tree-permit settlement
  Q->>Q: settlement watcher retains permit until durable child self-release/lease absence or exact child death
  Note over S,Q: Neither target absence nor monitor return releases the durable tree permit
